      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُسْلُوبَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A certain game of the Arabs of the
desert:</i> or <i>some action that they perform among
them:</i> one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْنَهُمْ أُسْلُوبَةٌ</span> [<i>Among them is a
performance of what is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسلوبة</span>]. (Lh, M.)

